    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This charming 3 bed traditional farmhouse is beautifully situated in Coomfarna, Dunbeacon, set on approximately 2 acres of rolling countryside. The property enjoys lovely views across the surrounding fields and open landscape, while the hills to the north-west provide a wonderful sense of shelter and privacy.\r\nTucked away off the beaten track, the setting is exceptionally peaceful and private, yet conveniently positioned equidistant between Schull and Durrus, both approximately 10 km away.\r\nThe house has been lovingly maintained and retains plenty of traditional character and charm, with clever use of space throughout. The surrounding grounds contain elevated seating areas perfect for enjoying the fresh country air and beautiful views. A pond provides a haven for local wildlife and plenty of space offers the opportunity to grow your own fruit, vegetables and flowers.\r\nThis is perfect for those looking to enjoy a quieter, more sustainable way of life in beautiful West Cork.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nc. 2-acre plot.\r\nGated laneway to property\r\nSolid fuel stove and electric heaters\r\nDouble glaze windows and doors\r\nGarden shed\r\nLarge garden shed/workshop\r\nPond\r\nPrivate well and septic tank\r\nNew septic tank and separate septic tank in bottom field. Also new.\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
      },
